le health experts with 10+ years of clinical knowledge and experience of helping over 2,500 women </li><li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Science meets clinical expertise: </span>Our formula merges science-backed ingredients with clinical expert knowledge </li><li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Third- party tested:</span> for all dietary preferences: vegan, dairy- free, nut-free, soy-free, gluten-free </li></ul>"
          }
        },
